// One complete Arb ACTSIM reference round: six concurrent producers.
// First retain the six concurrent FFFFFFFE/FFFFFFFF packets.
// Then serve one source at a time: tagged header, nonterminal payload, terminal payload.
// Functional stress and uncontended performance are separate phases; the DUT is unchanged.
// No winner order is imposed. All progress uses four-phase feedback.
// Reference: Implementation/PRS/tb/block/no_forks/tb_Arb.act.
